 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516546,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "At the Fremont County fair, there were 2,532 adult visitors. Of these, 1,679 purchased the Adult Mega Pass. What percent of the adult visitors purchased the Adult Mega Pass?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The formula relating the total (base), the percent in decimal form, and the part (amount) is</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"part = percent \\times total\"></span>.</p>\n<p>1,679 is what percent of 2,532?</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"1,679 = percent \\times 2,532\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{1,679}}{{2,532}} = \\frac{{percent \\times \\cancel{{2,532}}}}{{\\cancel{{2,532}}}}\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"0.6631 \\approx percent\"></span></p>\n<p>To convert the number <i>x</i> from decimal form to percent, multiply <i>x</i> by 100 and place a percent sign, %, after the number: (<i>x</i> × 100)%.</p>\n<p>0.6631 = 66.31%</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "66.31%"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
